WEBVTT

00:05:00.004 --> 00:05:03.466
Lasting conservation comes from within.

00:05:03.507 --> 00:05:07.094
From believing,
from belonging, from dreaming.

00:05:07.762 --> 00:05:10.389
So whether you are
a conservationist yourself

00:05:10.389 --> 00:05:12.224
or a donor or a media outlet,

00:05:12.224 --> 00:05:14.310
or maybe just plain curious,

00:05:14.352 --> 00:05:16.479
let's be vessels for that,

00:05:16.479 --> 00:05:18.814
for stewardship, for ownership,

00:05:18.814 --> 00:05:20.191
for pride.

00:05:20.566 --> 00:05:22.860
Don’t just tick the boxes.

00:05:22.902 --> 00:05:24.779
Ask the difficult questions.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.364
And always wonder:

00:05:26.364 --> 00:05:29.784
Are we working for communities

00:05:29.784 --> 00:05:31.744
or with communities?